  Release Notes for 0.3.0

 o FEATURE: Authors window: one window with a persistent, reorderable
            trail of authors down the side and a page per author,
            replacing the previous window-per-author

 o FEATURE: The author trail survives restarts, stored in the library
            database

 o FEATURE: Author photos: fetched from Wikidata, chosen from a file,
            or dragged in from a web page. Shown in the page header
            and beside each name in the trail

 o FEATURE: "Search the web for a photo" opens an image search for
            the author, and the chosen picture can be dragged
            straight onto the avatar

 o FEATURE: Collaborator cartouches: likely PI and group-member
            relationships inferred from shared publications, with
            single-vote inferences greyed to show they are weak

 o FEATURE: OpenAlex API-key support, for the daily quota introduced
            in February 2026

 o CHANGE:  PI inference prefers corresponding-author status over
            author position

 o CHANGE:  Card end-margin widened clear of the overlay scrollbar

 o BUG-FIX: Reference lookup made more robust

 o BUG-FIX: The sidebar's institution line is backfilled once the
            author profile arrives

 o BUG-FIX: A dropped image URL that points at a web page rather than
            an image now resolves through the page's og:image

 o BUG-FIX: The avatar menu opens on either mouse button

